{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17279","headline":"送韦中丞奉使新罗 · 权德舆","name":"送韦中丞奉使新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淳化洽声明，殊方均惠养。\n计书重译至，锡命双旌往。\n星辞北极远，水泛东溟广。\n斗柄辨宵程，天琛宜昼赏。\n孤光洲岛迥，净绿烟霞敞。\n展礼盛宾徒，交欢觌君长。\n经途劳视听，怆别萦梦想。\n延颈旬岁期，新恩在归鞅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}